~ start
if GlobalVariables.haspass == false
	There's a row of shields blocking the way. They're forming a magic barrier I can't pass.
	Some weird writing is on all of them that I don't recognize. They won't budge at all.
	Maybe there's something around here I can use to break them?
	do CutsceneManager.endcutscene()
if GlobalVariables.haspass2 == true
	do sfx_success()
	I held the key out towards the shields, and they both disappeared.
	do get_tree().call_group("breakable_wall", "killwalls")
	do CutsceneManager.endcutscene()
=> END